  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Fenomenal Funds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to New Venture Fund is for Fenomenal Funds, a feminist funder collaborative that seeks to advance the resilience and visibility of members of the Prospera International Network of Women&#x2019;s Funds. Fenomenal Funds aims to ensure more and better resources for feminist movements by strengthening the ecosystem of women&#x2019;s funds through shared governance and participatory grantmaking between women&#x2019;s funds and private philanthropy. During the grant period, Fenomenal Funds will deepen its work with an emphasis on mutual learning, narrative infrastructure funding, strategic engagement with peer funders, and sustaining aligned action in shared governance. (Strategy: Women&#x2019;s Economic Empowerment Initiative)</narrative>
  </description>
